      "title": "I–V–vi–IV",
      "body": "One progression is everywhere in pop: **I–V–vi–IV**, or 1–5–6–4. In C major that is C, G, Am, F.\n\n**Why it matters:** Let It Be, No Woman No Cry, With or Without You and hundreds more use it. Learn it in a few keys and you can join in on a lot of songs.",
